$ tools/terminal_value.py pe --roic .12 --g 0 --r .08

PE(终值) = (1 - g/ROIC) / (r - g)

  ROIC = 12.0%   g = 0.00%   r = 8.00%

  留存率 g/ROIC   = 0.0000 / 0.12 = 0.0000  (0.0%)
  分子 1 - 留存率 = 1.0000                    （即派息率 100.0%）
  分母 r - g      = 0.0800 - 0.0000 = 0.0800  (8.0pct)

  退出 PE = 1.0000 / 0.0800 = 12.5x


$ tools/terminal_value.py irr --profit 8000 --mcap 223520.3357985 --pe 12.5 --years 10 --payout .03

IRR = (2036市值 / 今日市值)^(1/10) - 1 + 股息率 - 稀释率

  2036 市值 = 8,000 x 12.5x = 100,000
  今日市值 = 223,520
  总倍数   = 0.4474
  几何年化 = -7.73%
  股息-稀释 = +3.00%

  IRR = -4.73%


